msgctxt "menu:Marketing:description"
msgid "Tools for email campaigns, audience engagement, automation, and digital marketing workflows."
msgstr "Nástroje pre e-mailové kampane, zapojenie publika, automatizáciu a digitálne marketingové pracovné postupy."

